5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick our new system! I want to make sure whatever we choose actually works for the people on the floor, so let's make this great!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we make a sustainable choice, I believe we should look beyond the initial proposal and examine the actual long-term costs and financial patterns of our previous systems.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that long-term data is essential. To avoid repeating past failures, I want to understand where accountability breaks down during crises and how our project scopes typically drift over time.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited to be here! I want to make sure we don't pick something that just gets old and dusty or breaks as soon as we hand it back. Let's find something really awesome!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and a spirit of generosity. I believe the heart of any system is the people who sustain it.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I totally agree, Servas! The people are the most important part. I'm worried about the gear in the yards, so I want to see the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that the human element is vital, but we must also be realistic about the budget. I will examine the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"To address my concerns regarding accountability and scope drift, I will examine the support ownership during last winter's outage and the warehouse rule changes after new accounts.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to see the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move! I bet they'll tell us if things just got old or if they were messy!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such passion. To ensure our transition does not break the spirits of those who carry the load, I shall examine administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,That sounds like a great plan! I'm also going to look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover. I want to make sure the new system doesn't crash right when we're the busiest!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I believe our current selections are sufficient. By analyzing the renewal invoices and board minutes, I can identify the hidden costs that often emerge after the initial contract is signed. I am ready to proceed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I believe my chosen records will provide the necessary clarity on operational accountability and systemic drift. I have no need for further data at this time. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm all set too! I can't wait to see if the old tools were just sleepy or if they were actually broken. Let's go find out! I'm ready!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I find our collective approach to be most balanced. By looking at both the financial structures and the human experience, we shall find a path that serves everyone. I, too, am ready to proceed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm super ready! I can't wait to see what we find out about the yards and the calendar. Let's do our best to pick a system that really helps everyone!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let us move forward and see what the records reveal. I look forward to analyzing the findings with you all.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I concur. Let us proceed to the findings and analyze the evidence objectively. I look forward to seeing if the records reflect the systemic issues I suspect.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to go on a big treasure hunt in the files! I hope we find some really cool clues that help us pick the best one. See you all soon!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May the truths we uncover be a guiding light for us all. I wish you clarity and insight in your investigations. Until we reconvene, I bid you a productive search.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
